is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_pils_influence.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'pils_influence') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.pils_influence (catalogue 4.3; technical reference 10.7): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. Z — 0.51: the present line can be
// confirmed for 1 T and the usual wait; returning the card to the hand is free.
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'pils_influence');
!}

= Piłsudski’s Influence

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @support
- @conditional
- @oppose_military_interference
- @easy_discard

@support
title: Support his influence
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_support_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_support_present = 0 : Relation with Piłsudski +4 (not again within 12 months); Centrum dissent +3. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'pils_influence', 'support').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_support_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'pils_influence', 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@conditional
title: Support it on conditions
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_conditional_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_conditional_present = 0 : Concessions only with civilian control or responsibility before the Sejm. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'pils_influence', 'conditional').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_conditional_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'pils_influence', 'conditional');
!}
go-to: result

@oppose_military_interference
title: Oppose the army’s interference
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_oppose_military_interference_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_oppose_military_interference_present = 0 : Relation −4; Piłsudczycy dissent +3; no autonomous military power until the line changes. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'pils_influence', 'oppose_military_interference').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_oppose_military_interference_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'pils_influence', 'oppose_military_interference');
!}
